{"parse": {"title": "向雨林深处-00", "pageid": 89580, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%9B%E4%BD%A9%E6%8B%89%C2%B7%E5%90%91%E9%9B%A8%E6%9E%97%E6%B7%B1%E5%A4%84\" title=\"洛佩拉·向雨林深处\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">向雨林深处-00</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%90%91%E9%9B%A8%E6%9E%97%E6%B7%B1%E5%A4%84-01\" title=\"向雨林深处-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">向雨林深处</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">00</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.BF.BD.E6.8D.95.E8.A1.8C.E5.8A.A8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"追捕行动\">追捕行动</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 追捕行动</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Manhunt</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshi\"><img alt=\"bangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/600px-Cg-bangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/900px-Cg-bangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>不，这次的行动我不会参加。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡西扬少校：</div><div>但你在卡洛斯将军的部署名单里，少尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对话才刚开始不久，年轻少校的喉头就已经有些干涩，想必他已经一百次地预见过说服洛佩拉的工作会有多么艰苦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他有气无力地拍了拍手中的一沓名单与简报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡西扬少校：</div><div>“……索科罗居民与天使兄弟会暗中勾结，私运武器，阴谋杀害芝诺士兵，袭击营地……”总之，线报是这么说的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>你看不出来吗？名单上的嫌疑人只是普通的渔民和船夫，他们和兄弟会可闹不到一块去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡西扬少校：</div><div>我提醒过卡洛斯将军，但他确实相当信任他的线人提供的情报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>卡洛斯脑壳里长的其实是巴拉纳松果，这下我的话应验了吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡西扬少校：</div><div>对长官放尊重些，少尉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少校的嘴角轻微抽动。他强压住不敬的笑意，压低了声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡西扬少校：</div><div>……把它当作治安任务就好，抓几个人审一审，没有问题就放走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>治安任务？你是第一天在圣保罗当兵吗？只要卡洛斯敢带人去市区，当地人保管叫他吃枪子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>然后因为他们开了枪，卡洛斯就会扯着嗓子叫：暴乱！果真是蓄谋已久的暴乱！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡西扬少校：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡西扬少校：</div><div>洛佩拉，下命令的人不是我……但我会尽量和平地推进行动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡西扬少校：</div><div>你不需要直接参与战斗，你的任务是去圣保罗捞一个人，名叫桑德罗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>桑德罗？他又是什么人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡西扬少校：</div><div>背景信息中只提到桑德罗和兄弟会的人闹过一些不愉快，芝诺要派人找到他并带回芝诺保护，免得他遭到报复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>我懂了，卡洛斯要找人替他干脏活——这我可不干。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>这事你扔给别的什么人都行，我呢——哦，我今天还要去圣保罗买一些绿蜂胶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>洛佩拉在随身携带的坩埚上轻轻一拍，像一只鲜艳夺目的鸟儿那样扑腾着离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡西扬少校：</div><div>……唉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少校没有刻意阻拦，他回到文件堆里，思考着如何兑现自己“和平推进行动”的承诺。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lvguan\"><img alt=\"lvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/600px-Cg-lvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/900px-Cg-lvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/1200px-Cg-lvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从芝诺基地到圣保罗市区的旅途她早已驾轻就熟，找到一个安全隐蔽的落脚处更是轻而易举。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拨通记忆中的号码，在沙哑的信号忙音中平复一路奔波后的喘息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>圣保罗街头扬起的灼热尘埃从窗缝中钻进来——躁动而浓烈，多半是因为其中混着年事已高的大排量汽车尾气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……你好？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>姐姐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-517911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-517911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-517911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……洛佩拉？你为什么要用普通电话线路？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>这你就别管了，出发之前我得和你说说圣保罗的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>出发之前……你在干什么？碰上什么麻烦了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>卡洛斯那个白痴就是最大的麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-517911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-517911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-517911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>卡洛斯？你已经说过他很多次了，父亲认为没有必要——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵模糊而沉重的声音中断了姐妹二人的谈话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-517913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-517913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-517913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>——嗯？对，是洛佩拉……嗯，好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>……姐姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>——是我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>熟悉而遥远的声音饱含着克制的力量，如同地平线之上滚落的雷鸣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>父亲！我本来还想让姐姐转告你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>如果你想说的是卡洛斯的抓捕行动，那么，我已知情，圣保罗基地提交过一份报告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>没错，卡洛斯的妄想症又发作了，你肯定能看出来的，对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>我得阻止他，父亲，这么弄下去圣保罗肯定会乱套的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-516411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-516411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-516411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>……父亲？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>将军的沉默有些出乎意料——洛佩拉本以为父亲对此事的态度会更加果决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>毕竟在她看来，阻止卡洛斯的愚行是第一要务，这件事没有多少考虑的空间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>你在部署名单内吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>当然，我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不安的预感像蜘蛛一样爬上心头，这样的对话并不是第一次发生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>……我在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>为什么拒绝执行命令？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>洛佩拉咬住嘴唇，无法作答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>卡洛斯将军是你的长官，就算他确实是个白痴，这一点也不会改变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>长官下令，士兵执行，无论是要冲上滩头还是放弃阵地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>可是……我可以弄清楚到底发生了什么，父亲，我能证明卡洛斯的情报是错误的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-516413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-516413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-516413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>以士兵的身份挫败上级的作战行动？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/HeadIconSmall-516412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/HeadIconSmall-516412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/HeadIconSmall-516412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>洛佩拉，再往前进一步，这就可以被视作叛乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>——不！我绝没有这么想过！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>叛乱——这个词像钟锤一样敲上她的太阳穴，在颅内引起阵阵嗡鸣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手指紧紧扒住桌角，指节逐渐失去血色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>不是这样的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>你的任务是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她吸了吸鼻子，尽力重拾讲述的勇气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>是……去找一个叫做桑德罗的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>那就去找到桑德罗，严格遵守指令，不要做多余的事，完成任务后向你的长官汇报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“桑德罗”，这个名字化作一根纤细的救命稻草，正在远处摇晃着向她招手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>明白了，父亲，我一定会找到桑德罗的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>稍后我会评估你提供的信息。莫莉德尔，你和她还有没说完的话吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从听筒中传出的模糊声音判断，电话正在被转移到另一人的手上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……父亲没有说错，洛佩拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>我知道……但父亲真的会一直放着卡洛斯不管吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>芝诺人员和物资的补充速度仍然远远没有达到需要的标准，暂时没有人能替换他的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-517910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-517910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-517910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……不过，我答应你会找恰当的时机再与父亲谈论一次圣保罗的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不确定的承诺已经是最高的让步标准。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-517910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-517910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-517910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>那么……祝你行动顺利，洛佩拉。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "向雨林深处-00"}}